{{set "pageTitle" "Diensten - Voluyt Consultancy Amsterdam"}}
{{set "metaDescription" "Ontdek de expert diensten van Voluyt: Consultancy, Interim Management, Continuous Improvement, Business Intelligence, Learning & Development, en Performance Management."}}
{{set "keywords" "Voluyt diensten, consultancy, interim management, continuous improvement, procesverbetering, performance management, business intelligence, data-analyse, training, Amsterdam"}}

<section class="py-12 md:py-16 bg-voluyt-teal text-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-heading font-bold animate-fadeInDown">Onze Diensten</h1>
        <p class="text-lg mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto animate-fadeInUp">Wij bieden een geïntegreerd pakket aan diensten, ontworpen om uw organisatie op elk niveau te versterken en duurzame vooruitgang te realiseren.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            {{#each companyProfile.services}}
            <div class="animate-fadeInUp">
                {{> service-card title=this.title excerpt=this.shortDescription url=(concat this.slug ".html")}}
            </div>
            {{/each}}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-voluyt-bg-subtle">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-semibold text-voluyt-dark-text mb-4">Advies op maat nodig?</h2>
        <p class="text-voluyt-subtle-text mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">Elke organisatie is uniek. Neem contact met ons op om te bespreken hoe Voluyt uw specifieke uitdagingen kan aanpakken.</p>
        <a href="contact.html" class="btn-primary text-lg">Neem Contact Op</a>
    </div>
</section>
